{"version":1,"id":"live.miditool.in","preview":{"id":"live.miditool.in","objectName":"live.miditool.in","helpFilePath":"max://C74/help/m4l/live.miditool.in.maxhelp","renderMode":"page-subpatcher","helpdetailsHeaderHints":{"sourceBoxId":"obj-2","objectNameHint":"live.miditool.in","headerHeightPx":134,"headerRect":[10,10,757,134]},"selectedPageName":"basic","stableSelectedPageId":"basic__obj-2","availablePages":["basic","\"dictionary format\"","\"context (2)\"","\"context (1)\"","\"apply cycle\"","generator","transformation"],"pages":{"basic":{"pageName":"basic","pageId":"basic__obj-2","renderMode":"page-subpatcher","patcherRect":[0,26,924,796],"boxes":[{"id":"obj-24","maxclass":"comment","text":"live.miditool.in only functions when used inside of a Max for Live Generator or Transformation. You will need to copy the Max patch code into a Transformation or Generator device in Live.","rect":[10,137,556,33],"patchingRect":[10,137,556,33],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial Bold","fontsize":12,"linecount":2},{"id":"obj-15","maxclass":"dict.view","text":"","rect":[329,414,155,145],"patchingRect":[329,414,155,145],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0},{"id":"obj-26","maxclass":"comment","text":"When live.miditool.in receives a bang or the apply button is pressed from the Live UI, the left outlet outputs a dictionary containing notes from the MIDI editor. The right outlet outputs a dictionary containing contextual information (grid size, start time of first note, end time of last note, etc.).\n\nWe can process this data, or generate our own and send it back to live.miditool.out to create a note transformation or generator.","rect":[155,226,307,152],"patchingRect":[155,226,307,152],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13,"linecount":10},{"id":"obj-11","maxclass":"newobj","text":"live.miditool.out","rect":[51,536,98,23],"patchingRect":[51,536,98,23],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0},{"id":"obj-10","maxclass":"dict.view","text":"","rect":[160,414,155,145],"patchingRect":[160,414,155,145],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0},{"id":"obj-5","maxclass":"button","text":"","rect":[51,191,24,24],"patchingRect":[51,191,24,24],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":1,"parameterEnable":0},{"id":"obj-1","maxclass":"newobj","text":"live.miditool.in","rect":[51,272,90,23],"patchingRect":[51,272,90,23],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":3},{"id":"obj-25","maxclass":"textbutton","text":"1","rect":[482,193,20,20],"patchingRect":[482,193,20,20],"ignoreclick":1,"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":3,"fontname":"Arial Bold","textcolor":[0.34902,0.34902,0.34902,1],"bgcolor":[0.9,0.65,0.05,1],"parameterEnable":0},{"id":"obj-6","maxclass":"comment","text":"bang causes live.miditool.in to output two dictionaries dictionaries","rect":[77,191,401,25],"patchingRect":[77,191,401,25],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13,"bubble":1}],"lines":[{"id":"pline-0","sourceId":"obj-1","sourceOutlet":0,"targetId":"obj-10","targetInlet":0,"midpoints":[60.5,400.5,169.5,400.5]},{"id":"pline-1","sourceId":"obj-1","sourceOutlet":0,"targetId":"obj-11","targetInlet":0},{"id":"pline-2","sourceId":"obj-1","sourceOutlet":1,"targetId":"obj-15","targetInlet":0,"midpoints":[96,400.5,338.5,400.5]},{"id":"pline-3","sourceId":"obj-5","sourceOutlet":0,"targetId":"obj-1","targetInlet":0}],"helpdetailsHeaderHints":{"sourceBoxId":"obj-2","objectNameHint":"live.miditool.in","headerHeightPx":134,"headerRect":[10,10,757,134]},"stats":{"boxCount":9,"lineCount":4,"presentationBoxCount":0}},"\"dictionary format\"":{"pageName":"\"dictionary format\"","pageId":"dictionary-format__obj-8","renderMode":"page-subpatcher","patcherRect":[0,26,924,796],"boxes":[{"id":"obj-10","maxclass":"newobj","text":"print \"live.miditool.in help file\"","rect":[284,330,177,23],"patchingRect":[284,330,177,23],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0},{"id":"obj-9","maxclass":"newobj","text":"dict.unpack notes:","rect":[284,288,113,23],"patchingRect":[284,288,113,23],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":2},{"id":"obj-8","maxclass":"comment","text":"The dictionary that it outputs contains an array all of the notes that were selected in the clip. \n\nEach note is a dictionary that has several keys associated to data that represnet properties of a note. It will seem familiar if you have used the Notes API before. These properties include:\n\nnote_id: [int] the unique note identifier.\npitch: [int] the MIDI note number, 0...127, 60 is C3.\nstart_time: [float] the note start time in beats of absolute clip time.\nduration: [float] the note length in beats.\nvelocity: [float] the note velocity, 0 ... 127.\nmute: [bool] 1 = the note is deactivated.\nprobability: [float] the chance that the note will be played:\n1.0 = the note is always played;\n0.0 = the note is never played.\nvelocity_deviation: [float] the range of velocity values at which the note can be played:\n0.0 = no deviation; the note will always play at the velocity specified by the velocity property\n-127.0 to 127.0 = the note will be assigned a velocity value between velocity and velocity + velocity_deviation, inclusive; if the resulting range exceeds the limits of MIDI velocity (0 to 127), then it will be clamped within those limits.\nrelease_velocity: [float] the note release velocity.","rect":[284,366,598,370],"patchingRect":[284,366,598,370],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13,"linecount":24},{"id":"obj-7","maxclass":"comment","text":"live.miditool.in outputs a dictionary of note information when it receives a bang.","rect":[143,239,464,21],"patchingRect":[143,239,464,21],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13},{"id":"obj-4","maxclass":"dict.view","text":"","rect":[51,288,208,286],"patchingRect":[51,288,208,286],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0},{"id":"obj-24","maxclass":"comment","text":"live.miditool.in only functions when used inside of a Max for Live Generator or Transformation. You will need to copy the Max patch code into a Transformation or Generator device in Live.","rect":[10,110,556,33